          },
          "docs": "Exchanges the physical storage of two tables in the same bucket. Async-only — returns 202 with a storage job; poll it for completion. Aliases are not transferred with table identity: each alias keeps pointing at the same physical position, so after the swap aliases expose the data of the other table. Both tables must live in the same bucket on the same backend connection.\n\nInitial response returns job details [JobResponse](#model-JobResponse). The result of the asynchronous job can be fetched vi"
